{
  "slug": "claude-code-tokenbudget",
  "name": "Claude Code Tokenbudget",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude code plugin to implement a budget or quota across all backends (Bedrock, Vertex, direct API) and provides guardrails against surprise token costs. No surprise bills, no config beyond a single env var, no external dependencies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `snooze` (Snooze the token quota — temporarily adds extra tokens to all limits for today), `status` (Show today's Claude Code token usage and quota status)\n- **Hooks** (2): `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-code-tokenbudget@claude-community` from `thedavidwhiteside/claude-code-tokenbudget`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 2
  },
